// AWS Lambda Function Created  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1098, T1648
// Detects creation of a Lambda function (logged as CreateFunction20150331). Attackers deploy functions as backdoors or to trigger on events.…
// False positives: Normal application/IaC deployments of functions.
// Source: rules/persistence/lambda-create-function.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^CreateFunction20150331$/i or eventName=/^CreateFunction$/i eventSource=/^lambda\.amazonaws\.com$/i
